---
// Example for `pnpm check:motion`: a passing .astro file. Feedback is color
// only; the transforms that remain are position (tooltip placement), not
// hover/press movement. Not part of any scan root; the check reads it as a
// self-test (docs/kits.md step 2.3).
---
<button class="hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 transition-colors">
  Save
</button>
<span class="group-data-[side=top]:-translate-y-1/2 -rotate-45 origin-center">caret</span>
<div class="translate-y-2 motion-reduce:transition-none">static offset</div>
<script>
  document.querySelector("[data-slot=panel]")?.classList.add("-translate-x-full");
</script>
